; The same ring written four ways. The first corner of each is what a nesting
; used to be decided at: a corner of the other ring, a point on an edge of it,
; a point clear of it, and the first of those again walked the other way round.
(loop geom:L-11
  (label "Counter return boundary, from the shared corner")
  (frame frame:building)
  (edges geom:E-11 geom:E-12 geom:E-13 geom:E-14))
